{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/8952c0b3f6a5c19977fb5a8fd0f7c79c.avif?t=1765252370\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS DESIGNED TO BE ENJOYED FOR ABOUT 1 - 1.5 HOURS</strong>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase Fox's seventh game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truth Universally Acknowledged - Seasilk Heart is a short mermaid dating sim.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talay, a recently transformed merperson, has to navigate a new life under the sea. Depending on your choices, Talay could find love, become a renowned dressmaker or save the oceans from a threat of mass destruction. With nothing but the passion for dressmaking, how far could Talay go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice of life, Romantic Comedy, Mermaid Core, Magical Realism, Dating Sim, Visual Novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art, Music &amp; Sound Design</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Love Interests</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/426b141ed959b05bbfc78d8675562d8c.avif?t=1765252370\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Vincent</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gardener who has an interest in botany and gemology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/793dc000988cfcbbee5be299e742f48f.avif?t=1765252370\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Emily</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An owner of a boutique in town. She is always lively and cheerful.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/331af4fafcc1a7f63e83f11a7e0302a5.avif?t=1765252370\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Mel</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A renowned dressmaker of the underwater world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision\u00a0Making</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you make choices by picking Talay's expressions. The story will be shaped based on what you picked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/ca60495d01bd949e03672542edc4e97e.avif?t=1765252370\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Flowchart</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flowchart allows the you to enter the story at specific points and access every story branches easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/27fe1d4138f99d77ee5b77ddc8565e01.avif?t=1765252370\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has multiple endings  decided by choices players made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/extras/2bdd1458c5acfc499764c0617b5d8fba.avif?t=1765252370\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story, Art, Music and Sound Design </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by ChaseFOX </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proofread</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Eskay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072110?t=1765252370","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072110?t=1765252370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/cb500f978d8293565810a8ed347d29c51a846391/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765252370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072110/cb500f978d8293565810a8ed347d29c51a846391/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765252370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description"